codex
One additional redundant sigmoid exists in Federated’s client-level inference path, so I’m removing it too; otherwise per-client validation would remain corrupted even if final `test.py` were fixed. HeteroSFL and H-SFP already threshold probabilities directly, so those paths need verification rather than a code removal. For pairing, I’ll enforce exact identifier-set equality instead of merely sorting two independent lists.
